## attempt_of_nothing (exit 1)
error[Z0206]: this gives no value, so it cannot be run by `attempt`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:9
  |
1 | attempt(print(1))
  |         ^^^^^^^^ its type is Nothing
  |
  = help: `print` and the other statements that print or warn return nothing; use the value they were given

